<title>UK: Korean broker to join London Stock Exchange.</title>
<headline>Korean broker to join London Stock Exchange.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea's LG Securities International is to join the London Stock Exchange to make a market in Korean Stocks on SEAQ International, the London Stock Exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Korean company's membership will take effect February 12, the LSE said.</p>
<p>&quot;(LG's) membership emphasises the role London plays in promoting the world's fastest growing economies,&quot; the Stock Exchange said. &quot;We look forward to their participation in the market.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London newsroom + 44 171 542 4366</p>
